  "content_id": "16136204",
  "title": "FIO Network Fees",
  "description": "FIO Protocol (FIO) – Simplifying Crypto Transactions\nFIO Protocol improves crypto usability by letting users send crypto to human-readable...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ6J8N3E22CDXTJ3QC8X21S\">FIO Protocol (FIO) – Simplifying Crypto Transactions</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">FIO Protocol improves crypto usability by letting users send crypto to human-readable FIO addresses instead of long public keys.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ6J8N3ZBERZRW1ZX2MK708\">How FIO Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction fees</b> paid in <b>FIO tokens</b>.</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Some operations (like sending a FIO request) have a flat small fee.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge handles the FIO transaction fee calculations automatically for you.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ6J8N37K4ZD3QAM7GJNZB3\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Standard FIO fees</b> – No need for manual adjustments.</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ6J8N363SXGBJJBKDAM5XE\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Generally <b>$0.01 to $0.05 USD</b> depending on the FIO service action (e.g., sending, requesting payment).</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ6J8N3F5FCQTJZ2E1646BQ\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">FIO makes crypto easier for everyone by replacing wallet addresses with simple names. Edge Wallet integrates FIO functionality while keeping transaction fees super affordable and automatic.</p>",
  "author_id": 9849332,
  "state": "published",
